      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.14 (down from ₹6.70 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹94.7b (down 10% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹2.04b (down 68% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 2.2% (down from 6.1% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Revenue was in line with analyst estimates. Earnings per share (EPS) surpassed analyst estimates by 16%. Revenue is forecast to grow 13% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 12% growth forecast for the Luxury industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 7% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 15% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
